{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cSpring has come to the satoyama.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tanuki-kun receives a letter from Kitsune-kun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201dLet's have lunch together under the cherry blossom tree!\u201c\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satoyama note Spring walk is a point-and-click visual novel in which you aim for a destination while identifying plants in the satoyama in spring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tanuki-kun follows the memo in the letter and heads for the cherry blossom tree while identifying the plants along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A point-and-click visual novel depicting the lives of creatures in a mountain village in spring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live background music played on a Japanese transverse flute, and a hand-drawn world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proceed through the forest while observing and identifying plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the animals in the mountain village talk about the plants</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430090?t=1757333572","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430090?t=1757333572","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430090/0aaaafa354ac63f8c6c2cdcf3f353b33899bcd29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757333572","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430090/0aaaafa354ac63f8c6c2cdcf3f353b33899bcd29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757333572","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cSpring has come to the satoyama.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_